; ==========================================================================
; glamcleaners.net — the records this site needs at the business's own domain
;
; Generated by src/build.js from src/dns.js. Do not edit this file.
;
; The panel edit, in order:
;   1. Replace the A record that points elsewhere with the four below.
;   2. Point www and links at the Pages default domain, as the two CNAMEs below.
;   3. Delete the URL forward, and any wildcard record.
;   4. Attach glamcleaners.net to the repository once DNS answers:
;        gh api -X PUT repos/sgscrap/glam-team-cleaners/pages \
;          -f cname=glamcleaners.net
;
; Why the forward has to go: it rewrites every path to one address, so
; /links/ arrives at the homepage and every canonical on the site names a URL
; that immediately redirects away from itself.
;
; Why the wildcard has to go: *.glamcleaners.net currently resolves (to the same
; forwarder), which means every subdomain already "works" and none of them
; serves the site. GitHub's own guidance is not to use a wildcard at all.
;
; The links record is a second Pages site, not a path on this one. A Pages site
; holds one custom domain, so the bare subdomain is a second repository
; publishing the same page at its root — and the wildcard is exactly what would
; keep it showing the homepage instead.
;
; This file is the site's records only. The domain also carries email, and a
; provider that takes this file as the whole zone would stop it:
;
;   MX     10 mailserver.businessidentity.llc
;   TXT    "v=spf1 a mx include:spf.postal.businessidentity.llc ~all"
;   TXT    _dmarc "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; rua=mailto:bounce@dmarc.businessidentity.llc; fo=1"
;
;   ...and the DKIM records the current panel holds, which cannot be read from
;   outside it. As observed 2026-10-17 — copy them from the panel, not
;   from this comment.
;
; The whole sequence, in order, with the commands and the rollback: DOMAIN.md
; in the repository root.
; ==========================================================================

$ORIGIN glamcleaners.net.
$TTL 3600

; GitHub Pages, apex. GitHub's four addresses, and the same four over IPv6.
@       IN  A      185.199.108.153
@       IN  A      185.199.109.153
@       IN  A      185.199.110.153
@       IN  A      185.199.111.153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8003::153
www     IN  CNAME  sgscrap.github.io.
links   IN  CNAME  sgscrap.github.io.
